# The Crystal Grotto: a deep cave off the crypt where the second relic
# shard sleeps in the living crystal. Re-authored to the Mines and Cave
# kit's 4-unit scale, so the organic rock pieces clad the open cavern
# cleanly. It is one wide cavern with 2x2 rock-pillar islands and a sunken
# crystal pool at its heart, lit by bioluminescence. 1=wall, 0=open floor.
map GROTTO
size 20 16
tileset 13
music 0
area cave
# the cave stands about four units tall; the central pool sinks a unit and
# its roof drops, for a close, glittering hollow around the shrine
sector 0 0 64
sector 1 -16 48
walls
11111111111111111111
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10001100000000110001
10001100000000110001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10001100000000110001
10001100000000110001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
11111111111111111111
end
# the sunken crystal pool at the cavern's heart
fill 1 7 6 12 9
marker start 2 13 N
marker shrine 10 3 S
portal 2 14 DUNGEON grotto
npc 10 2 GROTTO Shrine NPC_SHRINE1
# the pool glows with its own cold light, brighter than the dim cavern
trigger ambient 112 - 7 6 12 6 12 9 7 9
# a line the first time the party descends to the crystal pool
trigger event 0 SAWPOOL 7 6 12 6 12 9 7 9
eventmsg SAWPOOL A POOL OF LIVING CRYSTAL GLOWS COLD IN THE HOLLOW BELOW.
biolume 9 7
biolume 12 8
biolume 3 3
biolume 16 11
torch 2 12
torch 17 3
prop 3 13 BARREL
loot 10 3 100 GEODE 1
loot 3 13 0 WARDSHLD 1
